  "text": "### Real Examples  \n**Case 1: Danske Bank (AML Failure)**\n- Issue: Allowed £200B suspicious money through\n- Consequence: €1B fine, CEO resigned, reputation destroyed\n- Why: Staff ignored suspicious transactions  \n**Case 2: Wells Fargo (Account Fraud)**\n- Issue: Staff created fake accounts without authorization\n- Consequence: $3B fine, CEO prosecution, massive layoffs\n- Why: Pressure to meet targets; ignored ethics  \n**Case 3: Facebook (GDPR Violation)**\n- Issue: Shared user data without consent\n- Consequence: €110M fine, ongoing investigation\n- Why: Didn't respect user data rights",
